Based on the FeatFlow benchmark results (TU Dortmund) for the benchmark of Schäfer, M., Turek, S., Durst, F., Krause, E., Rannacher, R. (1996). Benchmark Computations of Laminar Flow Around a Cylinder.
In: Hirschel, E.H. (ed) Flow Simulation with High-Performance Computers II. Notes on Numerical Fluid Mechanics, vol 52. Vieweg+Teubner Verlag.
https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-322-89849-4_39
Published at https://wwwold.mathematik.tu-dortmund.de/~featflow/en/benchmarks/cfdbenchmarking/flow.html
Processed data (evaluated with visualize.py, see fetch_featflow.py). All changes are licensed under DuMux Project contributors CC-BY-4.0
